<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>邮箱验证码</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px 32px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin: 0 0 32px; }
    .code { font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: 8px; font-weight: 700; color: #16a34a; background: #f0fdf4; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; word-break: break-all; }
    .hint { font-size: 13px; color: #999; margin: 20px 0 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #bbb; text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
      <h1 class="title">邮箱验证码</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">您正在请求一次身份验证，请在页面中输入以下验证码：</p>
      <div class="code">{{code}}</div>
      <p class="hint">验证码 5 分钟内有效，请勿转发给他人。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">系统邮件，请勿回复</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>